    {
      "text": "A narrow vertical strip of shifting colour bands (blue, orange, green tones) with no legible content, on the AXIS 3 Financial health thematic-overview page; appears to be a decorative sidebar divider rather than an informative graphic. Content beyond the colour bands could not be determined from the extracted image.",
